00:05:31,304 --> 00:05:37,304
Villains aren't born. They're made.

2
00:11:02,608 --> 00:11:08,608
Kraven the Hunter is a action, adventure,
thriller film directed by J.C. Chandor.

3
00:16:33,913 --> 00:16:39,913
Kraven Kravinoff's complex relationship with his ruthless gangster father, Nikolai, starts him down a path of vengeance with brutal
consequences, motivating him to become not only the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.

4
00:22:05,217 --> 00:22:11,217
Sergei Kravinoff / Kraven the Hunter, played by Aaron Taylor-Johnson.

5
